WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:13.630
Roxy took a step.

2
00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:16.311
Bam! She hit a mirror.

3
00:00:17.352 --> 00:00:19.073
All of her reflections rubbed their heads.

4
00:00:19.093 --> 00:00:23.735
"Ugh! I'm stuck in an enormous mirror maze!"

5
00:00:26.417 --> 00:00:27.938
"Yes, you are!"

6
00:00:28.418 --> 00:00:29.839
Jack Hammer appeared in the mirrors.

7
00:00:32.264 --> 00:00:34.046
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

8
00:00:35.227 --> 00:00:36.368
Ping! Ping!

9
00:00:36.928 --> 00:00:38.350
The beams bounced off the mirrors.

10
00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:40.912
Roxy ducked as they passed by her head.

11
00:00:42.013 --> 00:00:44.736
Jack Hammer laughed.

12
00:00:44.976 --> 00:00:48.119
"So long, Rocket Girl!"

13
00:00:50.781 --> 00:00:52.923
Roxy banged into mirrors again and again.

14
00:00:54.745 --> 00:00:57.007
After a few minutes, she was still in the maze.

15
00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:01.261
"How will I get out of here?"

16
00:01:01.541 --> 00:01:02.222
Roxy thought.

17
00:01:03.683 --> 00:01:04.704
Then she had an idea.

18
00:01:06.986 --> 00:01:08.287
She blew her freeze breath.

19
00:01:11.489 --> 00:01:12.991
The mirrors filled with frost.

20
00:01:14.172 --> 00:01:17.634
Cracks crept along the glass, and then—smash!

21
00:01:19.296 --> 00:01:20.156
The mirrors shattered.

22
00:01:22.819 --> 00:01:24.180
Roxy saw an exit sign.

23
00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:31.470
"Yes!" Metro City Elementary School was empty when Roxy arrived.

24
00:01:34.391 --> 00:01:35.492
She called Terrell's phone.

25
00:01:38.033 --> 00:01:39.974
Using her super hearing, she heard it ringing.

26
00:01:44.457 --> 00:01:46.238
Roxy rushed to the phone and sighed.

27
00:01:47.058 --> 00:01:49.900
It was in their classroom, inside Terrell's backpack.

28
00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:52.701
Terrell, however, wasn't there.

29
00:01:55.222 --> 00:01:57.824
Walking through the school, Roxy used her super hearing again.

30
00:02:00.788 --> 00:02:02.530
She heard voices directly under the gym.

31
00:02:03.851 --> 00:02:05.312
Roxy punched through the floor.

32
00:02:05.972 --> 00:02:07.974
Beneath the floor there was an enormous funnel.

33
00:02:08.935 --> 00:02:11.837
Roxy jumped in and went down a long, twisting slide.

34
00:02:18.403 --> 00:02:21.165
Everyone was at the bottom, trapped in a big empty room.

35
00:02:22.646 --> 00:02:23.507
"Rocket Girl!"

36
00:02:23.747 --> 00:02:24.367
Terrell said.

37
00:02:24.387 --> 00:02:29.892
"Whew!" Principal Penn wiped her brow.

38
00:02:29.912 --> 00:02:30.552
"You found us!"

39
00:02:33.594 --> 00:02:35.354
Roxy brought everyone back to safety.

40
00:02:39.356 --> 00:02:40.876
I have to find Jack Hammer!"

41
00:02:43.678 --> 00:02:45.458
Roxy spotted the builder behind the school.

42
00:02:46.339 --> 00:02:48.359
He was loading school computers into a van.

43
00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:51.621
"Stop right there!"

44
00:02:51.861 --> 00:02:52.601
Roxy shouted.

45
00:02:52.621 --> 00:02:58.023
"Never!" Jack Hammer fired a nail gun at Roxy.

46
00:02:58.784 --> 00:03:01.685
"Yikes!" Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

47
00:03:02.165 --> 00:03:02.986
Jack Hammer ducked.

48
00:03:03.686 --> 00:03:06.168
The beams bounced off his hard hat and shattered a window.

49
00:03:07.849 --> 00:03:10.830
"Ha-ha!" The villain hopped into his van and took off.

50
00:03:12.951 --> 00:03:13.952
Roxy shot after him.

51
00:03:15.713 --> 00:03:18.114
Flying alongside the van, she used her heat vision.

52
00:03:20.475 --> 00:03:22.036
The van's doors melted shut.

53
00:03:23.057 --> 00:03:25.218
"Hey!" Jack Hammer yelled.

54
00:03:26.139 --> 00:03:28.320
Roxy zapped the tires with her eye laser beams.

55
00:03:28.984 --> 00:03:30.905
The van slid through a puddle and stopped.

56
00:03:34.506 --> 00:03:36.026
Jack Hammer tried to open the door.

57
00:03:36.066 --> 00:03:37.687
"Oh no!

58
00:03:38.187 --> 00:03:39.587
I'm—" "Trapped!"

59
00:03:40.067 --> 00:03:41.048
Roxy smiled.

60
00:03:43.809 --> 00:03:45.289
Roxy took Jack Hammer to jail.

61
00:03:47.230 --> 00:03:48.630
Next she flew to his building.

62
00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:51.591
All the stolen items were there.

63
00:03:53.351 --> 00:03:54.712
Finally she returned to school.

64
00:03:58.636 --> 00:03:59.858
"How was indoor recess?"

65
00:04:00.278 --> 00:04:01.259
Roxy asked her friends.

66
00:04:01.279 --> 00:04:03.301
"It was great!"

67
00:04:03.562 --> 00:04:04.182
Mara said.

68
00:04:04.202 --> 00:04:06.064
"Yeah!" Jack said.

69
00:04:06.084 --> 00:04:08.727
"There's a big slide under the gym!"

70
00:04:10.670 --> 00:04:13.393
Roxy and Terrell shot each other a quick look and smiled.
